  "abstract": "W3C Decentralized Identifiers: DID and DID URL syntax, DID documents, representations and media types, resolution and dereferencing, DID methods and their evaluation, and security and privacy. Targets the DID 1.0 Recommendation (19 July 2022), previews DID 1.1 (Candidate Recommendation Snapshot, 5 March 2026, posture build), and covers DID Resolution 1.0 (Candidate Recommendation Draft, 1 October 2026) as its own family. References are split into versions, syntax and URLs, DID documents, resolution, methods (including the DID Extensions notes, the DID Method Rubric and did:web), and security and privacy.",
